   "sentenceId": 4,
   "he": "אָמַר אֶפְרַיִם סָפְרָא תַּלְמִידוֹ שֶׁל רֵישׁ לָקִישׁ מִשּׁוּם רֵישׁ לָקִישׁ: הֲלָכָה כְּרַבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן. אַמְרוּהָ קַמֵּיהּ דְּשַׁבּוּר מַלְכָּא, אֲמַר לְהוּ: אָפְרִין נִמְטְיֵיהּ לְרַבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן.",
   "en": "«Efrayim the scribe, a student of Reish Lakish, says in the name of Reish Lakish:» The «halakha» is «in accordance with» the opinion of «Rabbi Shimon. They stated» this case «before» the Persian «King Shapur,» who expressed an interest in this legal issue, and «he said to them: Let us offer praise [apiryon] to Rabbi Shimon.» He too felt that this was the best resolution."
  }
